{"t":"2026-05-28T02:56:47.398Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01ViCMb5LS4DT8s8bYiVCPxN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the context I need. Let me write the test file for `tests/discovery/test_orchestrator_pubsub.py`. Based on the HYPHA-TESTS.md acceptance criteria, I need to:\n\n1. Use `fakeredis.aioredis` for Redis mocking\n2. Use in-memory SQLite for database\n3. Assert 8+ events in sequence (RUN_STARTED not actually emitted by current orchestrator, but CANDIDATE_LOADED, PROFILE_BUILT, MANIFEST_BUILT, CRAWL_COMPLETE, SCORING_COMPLETE, RUN_COMPLETE are)\n4. Assert no duplicate events\n5. Assert RUN_COMPLETE is last\n\nLet me first check if fakeredis is already a dependency and examine how the orchestrator currently publishes events:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8253,"cache_read_input_tokens":85437,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8253,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f2750489-d8d6-41f5-b42f-4d2a4cab3a05","uuid":"cfecca74-c876-4732-9789-6eb6d78bbcc8"}}
